'''Red Cloud Roost''' is an area located at Mulgore. Found atop a spire at the [[Red Cloud Mesa]], it's here where fledgling wyverns are given the training needed to transport passengers around Kalimdor.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20260514170802/https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps New Zones & World Edits]. Archived from [https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps the original] on 2026-05-14. Retrieved on 2026-29-08.</ref>

